### REST Client — S9.4 MCP y herramientas externas.
### Parser de config + recomendador de servers + security checker.

@host = http://localhost:5116

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Parsear config con tres servers (filesystem + ADO + GitHub)
POST {{host}}/mcp/config/parsear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "json": "{\"mcpServers\": {\"filesystem\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem\", \"/home/dev/projects\"]}, \"azure-devops\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@anthropic/mcp-server-azure-devops\"], \"env\": {\"AZURE_DEVOPS_PAT\": \"${ADO_PAT}\"}}, \"github\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"], \"env\": {\"GITHUB_TOKEN\": \"${GH_TOKEN}\"}}}}" }

### Parsear config inválida (sin clave mcpServers)
POST {{host}}/mcp/config/parsear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "json": "{\"otraCosa\": {}}" }

### Recomendar servers: equipo con ADO + GitHub + Cosmos + Notion
POST {{host}}/mcp/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usaAzureDevOps": true,
  "usaGitHub": true,
  "usaCosmosDb": true,
  "usaNotionODocs": true,
  "usaSlackOTeams": true
}

### Recomendar servers: equipo minimal (solo filesystem + GitHub)
POST {{host}}/mcp/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usaGitHub": true }

### Seguridad: config con token GitHub HARDCODED (Critico)
POST {{host}}/mcp/seguridad
Content-Type: application/json

{ "json": "{\"mcpServers\": {\"github\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"], \"env\": {\"GITHUB_TOKEN\": \"ghp_abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789\"}}}}" }

### Seguridad: filesystem con / (Critico)
POST {{host}}/mcp/seguridad
Content-Type: application/json

{ "json": "{\"mcpServers\": {\"filesystem\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem\", \"/\"]}}}" }

### Plan + checklist completo
POST {{host}}/mcp/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "escenario": {
    "usaAzureDevOps": true,
    "usaGitHub": true,
    "usaCosmosDb": true,
    "usaNotionODocs": true,
    "usaSlackOTeams": true
  },
  "configJson": "{\"mcpServers\": {\"filesystem\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem\", \"/home/dev/projects\"]}, \"github\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"], \"env\": {\"GITHUB_TOKEN\": \"${GH_TOKEN}\"}}}}"
}
